	(text "MERGE NOTE (PR #30, Joshua): Jake owns this sheet, so where Joshua's PR #30 overlapped Jake's PR #31, Jake's version was kept.\nKept from #30 (moved right so they don't overlap): RV901 MIDI_CH pot, RV903 pot, their power symbols (#PWR0903 renamed #PWR0911).\nDropped from #30 because they overlap #31 or another owner's sheet:\n- J902 USB_B connector, its D+/D-/VBUS_TVS labels and GND (Jake's J902 USB-A and J903 USB-B replace it)\n- RV902 Whammy and RV904 Mod_Wheel pots and labels (Jake has Whammy Bar Pickup / Mod Wheel Pickup)\n- J903 2x4 piezo connector and its moved Piezo labels (Jake put the piezo pins on J901)\n- J901 AudioJack3 TRS MIDI jack and TRS_TIP/RING/Sleeve labels (Jake removed TRS and uses USB-B for MIDI)\n- BT901 battery and its VBat label (the battery lives on Daniel's power sheet: BT1/J_BAT301)\nJoshua and Jake: talk it through if anything dropped should come back. MIDI_CH has no sheet pin on the root yet."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.494 120.65 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0ed3d940-8137-4543-8c02-535051138ba8")
